PTX CoRR+relaxed.cluster+same-cta
"CoRR: a thread reads a new value, then an older one, of the same location; same cta"
{
x=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0 | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0 ;
 st.relaxed.cluster x, 1  | ld.relaxed.cluster r0, x ;
                          | ld.relaxed.cluster r1, x ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
